WEBVTT

00:01:51.610 --> 00:01:52.440
Master.

00:01:57.360 --> 00:01:58.200
What?

00:01:59.660 --> 00:02:00.700
Are you...

00:02:01.530 --> 00:02:03.200
trying to insult me?

00:02:10.250 --> 00:02:12.090
That was cheap, old man.

00:02:35.780 --> 00:02:38.700
Raitai's first round
starts with a turbulent match!

00:02:39.280 --> 00:02:42.570
Sea King Ryu was defeated by Yujiro Hanma,

00:02:42.660 --> 00:02:44.700
the Japanese martial artist.

00:02:48.790 --> 00:02:49.960
MOHAMMAD JR.
SEA KING JO

00:02:50.040 --> 00:02:53.210
Here are the contestants
for the second match.

00:02:54.420 --> 00:02:56.710
Boxer Mohammad Jr. versus...

00:02:57.800 --> 00:02:59.760
Sea King Jo.

00:03:08.100 --> 00:03:09.020
Excuse me.

00:03:11.560 --> 00:03:12.810
Do you remember me?

00:03:13.400 --> 00:03:14.730
We met in Tokyo.

00:03:15.230 --> 00:03:17.650
Oh, what a coincidence!

00:03:17.940 --> 00:03:19.740
I didn't expect you here.

00:03:20.200 --> 00:03:24.490
I was surprised to hear
you joined the tournament.

00:03:26.120 --> 00:03:27.040
Don't worry.

00:03:27.450 --> 00:03:28.750
I'll be the winner.

00:03:32.080 --> 00:03:33.500
Who's in the tournament?

00:03:36.380 --> 00:03:37.500
What a shock.

00:03:38.000 --> 00:03:40.970
I didn't know Baki Hanma was your lover.

00:03:41.550 --> 00:03:44.340
And he's not in his best condition.

00:03:55.860 --> 00:03:56.860
Don't worry.

00:03:57.190 --> 00:03:59.780
Let's pray for Mr. Baki's safe return.

00:04:02.150 --> 00:04:04.490
Listen, a prayer

00:04:04.700 --> 00:04:08.790
isn't meant for hopeless wishes
and selfish desires.

00:04:09.200 --> 00:04:12.290
It's a vow to make sure
something happens no matter what.

00:04:13.670 --> 00:04:15.330
Until he's matched with me,

00:04:16.330 --> 00:04:19.050
and perhaps if he matches with me,

00:04:20.300 --> 00:04:22.590
I'll make sure it ends without trouble.

00:04:29.470 --> 00:04:30.930
He's truly massive.

00:04:31.310 --> 00:04:33.890
Heaven's Giant, Sea King Jo.

00:04:35.850 --> 00:04:40.650
And over here is Mohammad Alai Jr.
with his boxing-style martial arts.

00:04:45.490 --> 00:04:50.200
The gong begins the match
for the first time today!

00:05:01.340 --> 00:05:03.010
It's already over!

00:05:03.260 --> 00:05:06.970
It ended incredibly fast, almost too fast!

00:05:08.550 --> 00:05:10.220
-What?
-It's a counterattack!

00:05:13.560 --> 00:05:16.730
He stands! Sea King Jo has stood up!

00:05:16.940 --> 00:05:18.730
The Sea King will keep fighting!

00:05:19.310 --> 00:05:20.860
That's obvious.

00:05:21.360 --> 00:05:25.360
The Sea Kings are fawned over
as protective gods for their country.

00:05:26.070 --> 00:05:30.070
They can't fall to guest fighters
twice in a row.

00:05:31.990 --> 00:05:33.910
That looked pretty rough.

00:05:34.200 --> 00:05:38.250
He still needs time to recover completely.

00:05:41.590 --> 00:05:43.250
Man, it's no use.

00:05:52.600 --> 00:05:54.770
He's underestimating the Sea King.

00:05:55.220 --> 00:05:58.350
He's going to wait
until he fully recovers.

00:06:00.610 --> 00:06:03.780
It seems he's recovered for now.

00:06:10.620 --> 00:06:13.530
-Jo's energy has gone up!
-He can win this!

00:06:20.080 --> 00:06:22.290
What an awful Raitai Tournament.

00:06:22.880 --> 00:06:25.210
He wasn't waiting for his recovery.

00:06:25.710 --> 00:06:29.130
It was for an opening
to end it in one speedy blow.

00:06:31.720 --> 00:06:32.850
We have a winner!

00:06:33.890 --> 00:06:35.770
What a conclusion!

00:06:35.850 --> 00:06:38.730
Two Sea Kings, the pride of our country,

00:06:38.810 --> 00:06:42.060
were consecutively defeated
by foreign martial artists!

00:06:42.650 --> 00:06:45.980
<i>Who could've predicted</i>
<i>this turn of events?</i>

00:06:46.650 --> 00:06:48.570
SEA KING LI

00:06:48.650 --> 00:06:50.570
BAKI HANMA

00:06:50.660 --> 00:06:55.830
<i>Sea King Li faces off against</i>
<i>Japan's fighting champion!</i>

00:07:03.500 --> 00:07:04.340
Baki.

00:07:05.420 --> 00:07:06.920
How shameful.

00:07:07.760 --> 00:07:09.470
I have something to tell you.

00:07:11.180 --> 00:07:13.010
Your opponent, Sea King Li,

00:07:14.300 --> 00:07:19.100
is the best Poison Hand user
in all of China.

00:07:24.310 --> 00:07:25.360
I see.

00:07:31.700 --> 00:07:35.120
I was hoping you'd be
matched with him at some point.

00:07:36.120 --> 00:07:38.120
This is really lucky.

00:07:39.500 --> 00:07:40.870
"Lucky."

00:07:41.710 --> 00:07:45.460
What part of this
made you believe I'm "lucky"?

00:07:46.460 --> 00:07:50.880
The title of "Sea King" alone
makes them a formidable threat.

00:07:51.510 --> 00:07:53.630
Yet he's also a Poison Hand user.

00:07:54.180 --> 00:07:56.640
We'll bet on Baki Hanma's
senses awakening.

00:07:59.520 --> 00:08:00.980
...full of yourself.

00:08:04.560 --> 00:08:05.400
What?

00:08:05.980 --> 00:08:08.230
You're so fucking full of yourself!

00:08:10.990 --> 00:08:13.150
Is this a game of chance to you?

00:08:14.660 --> 00:08:17.070
I won't let you do this!

00:08:18.990 --> 00:08:22.290
I won't let you bastards do as you wish!

00:08:30.130 --> 00:08:31.260
It's fine.

00:08:33.090 --> 00:08:35.260
You've done enough.

00:08:43.560 --> 00:08:46.190
You've given me courage.

00:08:47.610 --> 00:08:48.940
I won't lose.

00:08:52.990 --> 00:08:54.990
The third match will begin.

00:08:55.400 --> 00:08:58.200
Now, on the stage is Baki Hanma.

00:08:59.200 --> 00:09:00.490
At only 17 years old,

00:09:00.830 --> 00:09:04.960
Japan's combat king
has arrived at the Raitai Tournament!

00:09:08.000 --> 00:09:10.800
But what has happened
to Baki Hanma's body?

00:09:11.710 --> 00:09:12.960
Is he okay?

00:09:13.050 --> 00:09:14.720
Did he eat something bad?

00:09:17.050 --> 00:09:19.470
His opponent is Sea King Li.

00:09:20.050 --> 00:09:23.980
He is a user of our country's pride,
the Yakukoken!

00:09:26.770 --> 00:09:29.230
Now, the battle shall begin!

00:09:34.320 --> 00:09:36.490
It's a sudden kick!

00:09:39.410 --> 00:09:41.200
It's a clean hit!

00:09:44.370 --> 00:09:45.830
Right on the mark.

00:09:51.500 --> 00:09:53.960
Poison Hand, direct hit.

00:10:00.890 --> 00:10:03.010
<i>He already got me.</i>

00:10:09.440 --> 00:10:11.770
<i>All I can do is watch until the end.</i>

00:10:23.370 --> 00:10:24.790
He's sucking it.

00:10:30.830 --> 00:10:32.290
<i>Just as I thought.</i>

00:10:33.090 --> 00:10:35.800
Hey, you waited for me?

00:10:38.380 --> 00:10:39.800
How kind of you.

00:10:41.300 --> 00:10:42.890
<i>He's already poisoned.</i>

00:10:44.890 --> 00:10:47.060
What? A handshake?

00:10:49.440 --> 00:10:50.810
Oh, I see.

00:10:52.650 --> 00:10:54.070
Is this it?

00:10:54.650 --> 00:10:55.520
It's Tsui-shu.

00:10:55.610 --> 00:10:57.070
The legendary combat method.

00:10:57.650 --> 00:10:58.490
Tsui-shu.

00:11:00.660 --> 00:11:01.910
They want a quick match.

00:11:07.910 --> 00:11:09.580
<i>Aiki? At this stage?</i>

00:11:10.000 --> 00:11:10.830
<i>Yawara?</i>

00:11:27.010 --> 00:11:28.470
That was informative.

00:11:28.890 --> 00:11:30.730
-He blocked it!
-It didn't hit.

00:11:31.350 --> 00:11:34.230
<i>Yawara,</i> a traditional
Japanese martial art.

00:11:34.810 --> 00:11:36.860
I've been wanting to see it.

00:11:42.950 --> 00:11:45.200
He'll end it quickly.

00:11:48.580 --> 00:11:49.750
Let's continue.

00:12:06.890 --> 00:12:08.140
The Poison Hand!

00:12:08.220 --> 00:12:09.560
The Poison Hand is shrinking!

00:12:10.180 --> 00:12:11.770
His hand is getting smaller!

00:12:12.060 --> 00:12:15.060
Was the Poison Hand
hammered into the opponent?

00:12:24.990 --> 00:12:25.820
<i>Now...</i>

00:12:32.580 --> 00:12:33.660
<i>Now...</i>

00:12:36.670 --> 00:12:37.590
Now...

00:12:51.850 --> 00:12:54.100
Baki Hanma is down!

00:13:11.200 --> 00:13:12.200
Baki.

00:13:13.410 --> 00:13:15.620
Hey, this is...

00:13:18.670 --> 00:13:19.880
He changed.

00:13:21.630 --> 00:13:23.210
His arms were so thick.

00:13:25.630 --> 00:13:27.890
His legs were so manly.

00:13:29.890 --> 00:13:31.390
Even his steel body...

00:13:33.770 --> 00:13:36.230
Everything has changed.

00:13:38.150 --> 00:13:38.980
But...

00:13:40.820 --> 00:13:41.650
Baki.

00:13:46.240 --> 00:13:47.200
But...

00:13:47.660 --> 00:13:49.200
you haven't changed at all.

00:13:50.780 --> 00:13:54.120
Not a thing has changed about you.

00:14:01.040 --> 00:14:02.420
That brat.

00:14:03.170 --> 00:14:05.670
He found a nice girl.

00:14:06.420 --> 00:14:07.420
<i>The poison...</i>

00:14:09.510 --> 00:14:10.430
<i>is being negated!</i>

00:14:11.720 --> 00:14:13.060
<i>Even if you</i>

00:14:13.640 --> 00:14:14.680
<i>keep changing...</i>

00:14:16.520 --> 00:14:17.940
<i>No matter how much you change,</i>

00:14:21.060 --> 00:14:23.190
<i>you yourself will never change.</i>

00:14:57.060 --> 00:14:58.270
Baki!

00:15:02.310 --> 00:15:03.310
You...

00:15:04.980 --> 00:15:06.230
He's...

00:15:06.940 --> 00:15:08.490
It was negated!

00:15:09.700 --> 00:15:11.990
Negated?

00:15:12.570 --> 00:15:15.740
Kozue, Baki is coming back!

00:15:17.490 --> 00:15:18.790
You did well.

00:15:18.950 --> 00:15:21.210
You did well, Kozue.

00:15:22.960 --> 00:15:24.840
Your little brother

00:15:25.670 --> 00:15:27.460
cured him.

00:15:30.130 --> 00:15:34.350
<i>In 1540, China's Ming dynasty</i>

00:15:34.930 --> 00:15:38.390
<i>passed on the Jaken Poison Hand to Japan.</i>

00:15:39.560 --> 00:15:41.850
<i>The seven scrolls were thorough,</i>

00:15:42.190 --> 00:15:47.860
<i>covering poison production</i>
<i>and Poison Hand training methods.</i>

00:15:49.400 --> 00:15:52.610
<i>The military commander at the time,</i>
<i>Yoshimoto Imagawa,</i>

00:15:53.360 --> 00:15:56.410
<i>only allowed ninja to learn it.</i>

00:15:57.990 --> 00:16:01.120
<i>The ninja at the time</i>
<i>adopted the Poison Hand,</i>

00:16:01.830 --> 00:16:05.380
<i>killing enemies who were</i>
<i>aligned with Ujiyasu Hojo.</i>

00:16:05.920 --> 00:16:09.420
<i>It's said they killed over 90 figures.</i>

00:16:10.340 --> 00:16:13.430
<i>There were four more centuries</i>
<i>before modern times,</i>

00:16:13.970 --> 00:16:18.680
<i>and the Poison Hand was passed down,</i>
<i>hidden from history.</i>

00:16:19.140 --> 00:16:21.600
I'd like to say it all ended well,

00:16:22.020 --> 00:16:25.940
but China's brains
are nothing to scoff at.

00:16:26.650 --> 00:16:30.940
<i>Japan thought there were</i>
<i>seven Poison Hand scrolls.</i>

00:16:31.650 --> 00:16:34.950
<i>But there were actually</i>
<i>another five in existence.</i>

00:16:35.450 --> 00:16:39.450
The Yin-sided Hand for the first seven,
the Yang-sided Hand for the latter five.

00:16:40.870 --> 00:16:45.500
<i>The complete set has 12 scrolls,</i>
<i>covering both Yin and Yang.</i>

00:16:47.540 --> 00:16:51.300
The Yang-sided Hand is also
a form of Poison Hand.

00:16:52.090 --> 00:16:56.010
<i>But poison neutralization</i>
<i>has very limited conditions.</i>

00:16:57.300 --> 00:16:58.720
He's up!

00:16:59.050 --> 00:17:02.560
Japan's champion was on the ground
just a moment ago,

00:17:02.930 --> 00:17:05.480
but he stands in the arena once more!

00:17:10.020 --> 00:17:10.980
<i>I feel...</i>

00:17:12.860 --> 00:17:14.150
<i>kind of light.</i>

00:17:15.150 --> 00:17:17.490
<i>Oh, I'm so light.</i>

00:17:18.320 --> 00:17:23.000
<i>It almost feels like</i>
<i>I can jump all the way up there.</i>

00:17:24.620 --> 00:17:25.500
What?

00:17:27.580 --> 00:17:30.000
Sorry, I kept you waiting a while.

00:17:34.170 --> 00:17:36.010
Now, let's get to it.

00:17:54.230 --> 00:17:55.110
He's being stopped?

00:17:55.190 --> 00:17:57.910
He's stopping him before he can attack.

00:17:58.490 --> 00:18:00.410
He sees through Li's attacks.

00:18:03.200 --> 00:18:06.000
In any case, the poison has been negated.

00:18:07.000 --> 00:18:08.750
That much is for certain.

00:18:09.750 --> 00:18:14.170
Perhaps the Yin and Yang Poison Hands
did something in your body.

00:18:14.920 --> 00:18:19.180
Perhaps your will to fight made
a drug excrete from your brain.

00:18:19.840 --> 00:18:25.180
Perhaps the tears from your girlfriend
over there gave you euphoria,

00:18:25.770 --> 00:18:30.440
creating chemical substances
from your arousal.

00:18:31.020 --> 00:18:34.690
<i>Or perhaps all of this</i>
<i>meshed together inside of you,</i>

00:18:35.150 --> 00:18:37.110
<i>causing a chemical reaction.</i>

00:18:38.780 --> 00:18:44.330
Whatever happened in your body,
it's not good news to me.

00:18:47.120 --> 00:18:49.710
I've walked this path for a long time,

00:18:50.290 --> 00:18:53.210
but I've never seen this happen before.

00:18:53.540 --> 00:18:57.460
I'm not very smart,
and you're speaking in Chinese.

00:18:58.340 --> 00:19:00.970
I didn't understand
your explanation at all.

00:19:02.140 --> 00:19:02.970
But...

00:19:08.480 --> 00:19:12.730
my body wants me to defeat you.

00:19:14.820 --> 00:19:15.730
I told you.

00:19:16.820 --> 00:19:18.570
It will end quickly.

00:19:19.820 --> 00:19:20.740
How interesting.

00:19:21.780 --> 00:19:23.240
Why don't you try?

00:20:00.610 --> 00:20:02.110
<i>Sea King Li...</i>

00:20:04.910 --> 00:20:05.870
Doctor!

00:20:06.120 --> 00:20:07.910
<i>Whatever your reason may be...</i>

00:20:08.620 --> 00:20:10.040
<i>Whatever your motives may be...</i>

00:20:10.870 --> 00:20:13.040
<i>I'm able to stand like this</i>

00:20:14.370 --> 00:20:15.790
<i>thanks to you.</i>

00:20:22.380 --> 00:20:23.800
It's over!

00:20:23.880 --> 00:20:26.390
The victor is Baki Hanma!

00:20:28.100 --> 00:20:29.560
<i>Even more than before...</i>

00:20:29.640 --> 00:20:32.520
Baki, Baki, Baki!

00:20:32.600 --> 00:20:34.020
<i>Even more than before...</i>

00:20:35.520 --> 00:20:37.810
<i>I'm able to stand strong...</i>

00:20:41.150 --> 00:20:42.650
<i>thanks to you.</i>

00:20:56.290 --> 00:20:57.210
Thank you.

00:20:59.590 --> 00:21:00.750
You look pathetic.

00:21:07.180 --> 00:21:08.220
I knew it.

00:21:16.230 --> 00:21:17.480
You haven't changed.

00:22:41.900 --> 00:22:42.810
IDIOTS FROM PLANET STRONG

00:22:48.950 --> 00:22:50.700
Subtitle translation by Chul Kim
